From 25746c6f1dffbd39221cb98c6e52863812042a7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shivansh Seth <82285859+ShibuShivansh40@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 02:57:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix blank screen on web build

- Pin react-dom to 19.2.0 to match react (React error #527)
- Stop babel-loader from loading the React Native babel.config.js,
  which converted ESM packages to CommonJS ("exports is not defined")
- Make #root a flex container so the RN-web root view gets full height

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WREhoqRSdivyxanxt8x7DL
---
 index.html        |  4 ++++
 package-lock.json | 18 ++++++------------
 package.json      |  2 +-
 webpack.config.js |  2 ++
 4 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
index 92bad74..f41e55c 100644
--- a/index.html
+++ b/index.html
@@ -26,6 +26,10 @@
       -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
       user-select: none;
     }
+    #root {
+      display: flex;
+      flex-direction: column;
+    }
   </style>
 </head>
 <body>
diff --git a/package-lock.json b/package-lock.json
index cde23a5..3373417 100644
--- a/package-lock.json
+++ b/package-lock.json
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
